    {
      "id": "JOB.25.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.25.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then answered Bildad the Shuhite, and said,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.25.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.25.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Dominion and fear ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with him, he maketh peace in his high places.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.25.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.25.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is there any number of his armies? and upon whom doth not his light arise?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.25.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.25.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How then can man be justified with God? or how can he be clean ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " born of a woman?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.25.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.25.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold even to the moon, and it shineth not; and the stars are not pure in his sight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.25.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.25.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How much less man, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a worm; and the son of man, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a worm?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
